
{
  "uid": "spacedock-traces",
  "title": "SpaceDock - Distributed Tracing",
  "tags": [
    "spacedock",
    "tempo",
    "tracing",
    "opentelemetry"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Trace Volume",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Spans/sec",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Span Duration p95",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Spans by Service",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Trace Errors",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Span Duration p50 and p99",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Tempo Service Health",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "up{job=\"tempo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Tempo",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Observed Services",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(count by (service_name) (traces_spanmetrics_calls_total))",
          "legendFormat": "Services",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Trace Explorer",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Explore distributed traces\n\nOpen **Explore → Tempo** to search traces.\n\nUseful filters:\n\n- Service: `spacedock-api`\n- Service: `spacedock.backend`\n- Span status: `error`\n- Minimum duration: `1s`\n\nUse TraceQL to investigate slow requests, failed spans and service dependencies."
      }
    }
  ]
}
